1
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:48,920
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 4=

3
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:57,840
Yuanchu.

4
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,039
Where have you been?

5
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,840
Do you know
how I went through the whole night?

6
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:06,359
I was so worried
I could only eat five bowls of rice.

7
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,560
Do not worry, Senior.

8
00:01:08,937 --> 00:01:10,675
We just ran into a Deceit Beast.

9
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,000
But we also learned the truth
about the paper brides.

10
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:17,359
This place used ghost weddings
to traffic women.

11
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,560
We already knew.

12
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:22,040
Deceit Beast's spirit?

13
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,159
Why did you kill him?

14
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,719
He didn't kill the Deceit Beast.

15
00:01:27,512 --> 00:01:29,480
The Deceit Beast exhausted his power

16
00:01:29,937 --> 00:01:31,519
trying to save those women.

17
00:01:31,850 --> 00:01:33,037
That's why he ended up

18
00:01:33,275 --> 00:01:34,425
withered and dead.

19
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,400
He saved people,

20
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:40,760
yet people killed him.

21
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:44,439
They didn't kill him, but the truth did.

22
00:01:46,337 --> 00:01:47,456
What is a demon?

23
00:01:47,887 --> 00:01:49,008
What is a human?

24
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,799
In this world, humans are not humane,

25
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,879
and demons are not demonic.

26
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,439
Soul Vessel.

27
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:15,479
May he guard this place.

28
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,599
He got what he wanted.

29
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,879
He died for a worthy cause.

30
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,240
Far cleaner than those
who cling to a hollow life.

31
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,479
You're not

32
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,199
as insufferable

33
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,159
as I thought.

34
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:36,650
I've sent word

35
00:02:36,650 --> 00:02:38,475
to the local authorities to take over.

36
00:02:38,725 --> 00:02:41,080
The evil in Yong'an Village
will face justice.

37
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:42,120
Let's go.

38
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,319
The Wilds of Lize lie far ahead.

39
00:02:44,587 --> 00:02:46,280
I'll go pack some food.

40
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:57,719
What's wrong?

41
00:02:57,879 --> 00:03:00,759
Have you known Chi Xiao for long?

42
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:05,199
We grew up together in an orphanage.

43
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:07,080
Then Master took me in.

44
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,439
He became a Hunter.

45
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,439
We haven't seen each other since.

46
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:11,062
(I guess he really has nothing to do)

47
00:03:11,062 --> 00:03:12,319
(with Yu Linjun.)

48
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:14,159
Why are you asking about him?

49
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:17,800
You sure ask a lot of questions.

50
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,280
I'm a demoness.

51
00:03:19,487 --> 00:03:21,080
Of course I'm curious about men.

52
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,080
Come on, let's go.

53
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:35,400
The Wilds of Lize lie at the border.

54
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,039
Water is the fastest way.

55
00:03:38,112 --> 00:03:39,719
The Huanxi River is treacherous.

56
00:03:40,437 --> 00:03:41,840
No ordinary boat can cross it.

57
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,280
I have a way.

58
00:03:56,599 --> 00:03:57,840
The time has come.

59
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,319
What are you staring at?

60
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:13,479
It is Wu Zhiqi.

61
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:15,080
Hey! You messed up my look!

62
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,639
So annoying.

63
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:17,680
He's a water spirit
who knows every river.

64
00:04:18,162 --> 00:04:19,560
He can cross a thousand rivers in a day.

65
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,360
Oh dear.

66
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,920
You little demon know who I am?

67
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,759
We can use him to cross.

68
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,240
He owes me a favor.

69
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,040
Hold on.

70
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,879
I owe you one favor.

71
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:31,839
Not one favor

72
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:32,680
to each of you four.

73
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:34,439
Three humans and one demon...

74
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,600
You trying to work me to death?

75
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:41,319
Don't ruin my look!

76
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,439
Wu Zhiqi.

77
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:44,879
This works.

78
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,319
Old Wu Zhiqi
doesn't just know the waters.

79
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:51,600
He knows every hidden path
in this world.

80
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,600
Little demon, you know your stuff.

81
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:55,480
Come.

82
00:04:55,687 --> 00:04:57,399
I'll take you four across.

83
00:04:58,337 --> 00:04:58,950
Wait a moment.

84
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,560
(The young Taoist's bite mark
still hasn't appeared.)

85
00:05:09,912 --> 00:05:10,879
(I can't let them get to)

86
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:11,879
(the Wilds of Lize too soon.)

87
00:05:12,199 --> 00:05:13,680
(I need to pick a harder road.)

88
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,839
What are you doing?

89
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:29,120
Did Wu Zhiqi say he'd take us across?

90
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:30,639
Why did he run off?

91
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:32,439
Didn't he say crossing Fufo Ridge

92
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:34,519
leads to a shortcut
to the Wilds of Lize?

93
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,319
Is this route even real?

94
00:05:38,375 --> 00:05:39,600
Trust me.

95
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,560
It's absolutely real.

96
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,120
(I picked this route just for you.)

97
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,160
(Of course it's real.)

98
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,262
Which road is

99
00:05:45,262 --> 00:05:47,262
the most dangerous and hardest
to reach the Wilds of Lize?

100
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:49,279
Four hundred kilometers of Fufo Ridge.

101
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,680
No Buddha in sight, no peace of mind.

102
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:53,519
Thousands of twists and turns.

103
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,199
(Fufo Ridge has a maze
and man-eating demons.)

104
00:05:57,199 --> 00:05:58,519
(Even gods and demons can't get out.)

105
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:01,199
(Young Taoist, let's see you run now.)

106
00:06:01,199 --> 00:06:03,120
Be careful, Senior.

107
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,300
Senior?

108
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,875
This is bad.

109
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:16,100
We've fallen into the Leaf Veil Forest.

110
00:06:17,687 --> 00:06:18,900
Senior!

111
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,839
Chi Xiao!

112
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:21,600
Senior!

113
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,560
Chi Xiao!

114
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,680
Yuanlang!

115
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,279
Chi Xiao!

116
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:28,079
Chi Xiao!

117
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:30,839
Yuanlang!

118
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,075
Chi Xiao!

119
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:34,112
- Senior!
- Yuanlang!

120
00:06:37,037 --> 00:06:38,662
Where did they go?

121
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,240
Buddha hangs upside down.

122
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:47,759
Bodhisattva shuts its eyes.

123
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:50,399
This isn't right.

124
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:53,160
That's the seventh time
we've passed this spot.

125
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,519
We've been going in circles.

126
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,639
We never left.

127
00:06:56,439 --> 00:06:59,040
The Fufo Ridge must
have some kind of space barrier.

128
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:03,480
I'm still worried about
Yuanlang and Chi Xiao.

129
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,720
Don't worry.

130
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,839
Chi Xiao is incredibly powerful.

131
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,079
He'll protect Yuanlang.

132
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,800
And they have good fortune
on their side.

133
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,475
They've probably already crossed over

134
00:07:10,475 --> 00:07:11,079
and made it out.

135
00:07:11,637 --> 00:07:13,850
That's not how you use that phrase.

136
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,560
You pesky Taoist! Big-eared Taoist!

137
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,775
How dare you poke me!

138
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,275
Let's find them first,

139
00:07:22,275 --> 00:07:23,000
okay?

140
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,319
Mm.

141
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,519
Senior!

142
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,920
Yuanlang!

143
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:33,480
This place has no day or night.

144
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,160
I can't go on.

145
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:34,759
I need to sleep.

146
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:36,240
I'm so tired.

147
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,920
Why are you staring at me?

148
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,112
(Could she have deliberately)

149
00:07:43,112 --> 00:07:44,720
(led us into the Fufo Ridge?)

150
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,879
Nothing. You sleep. I'll keep watch.

151
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,920
(What if he leaves me here?)

152
00:07:54,587 --> 00:07:56,519
Actually, I'm not that tired anymore.

153
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,920
I feel like pulling an all-nighter.

154
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:59,720
How about this. I'll keep watch.

155
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,519
You sleep.

156
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,120
I am a man.

157
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:03,959
Let me handle this. You sleep first.

158
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,725
I'm a demon.

159
00:08:05,725 --> 00:08:07,879
I can stay up longer than any human.
You sleep.

160
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:08,879
I'm a Taoist.

161
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,639
I can outlast any demon. You sleep.

162
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:13,120
Listen to me.

163
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:14,240
You're very sleepy.

164
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:14,920
You're very sleepy.

165
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,519
You're very sleepy.

166
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:16,399
You're very sleepy.

167
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:19,439
I know everything.

168
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,680
Know what?

169
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,560
You know what I'm talking about.

170
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:25,000
(You pesky Taoist!)

171
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,399
(Trying to bluff me?)

172
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,560
Your heart is beating so fast.

173
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,120
Are you afraid of me,

174
00:08:32,879 --> 00:08:34,639
or have you fallen for me?

175
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:35,087
You...

176
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:37,480
(Did she figure it all out?)

177
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,720
You're not the Purestone Bloom.

178
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:43,039
Believe it or not.

179
00:08:45,037 --> 00:08:47,559
Young Taoist, are you afraid

180
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,879
that you've fallen for a demoness?

181
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:50,919
Speak the truth!

182
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,519
Heaven-earth righteousness

183
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,480
shine upon me.

184
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:55,440
Between man and woman,

185
00:08:55,675 --> 00:08:56,240
human and demon,

186
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,039
no intimacy.

187
00:08:57,279 --> 00:08:58,639
If you have any more impure thoughts,

188
00:08:59,050 --> 00:08:59,679
I will...

189
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,440
You'll what?

190
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:04,120
Isn't this exactly how we first met?

191
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,840
You want to throw me again?

192
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,399
You sleep first.

193
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,679
No, I won't.

194
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:12,799
I'll watch over you while you sleep.

195
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,840
I'm not sleeping.

196
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,240
You sleep.

197
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,799
No, no, no.

198
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,519
Fine, nobody sleeps.

199
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,279
Fine.

200
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,440
I'll outlast you.

201
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,240
Fine.

202
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,399
I...

203
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,279
I can't kill her.

204
00:09:39,512 --> 00:09:40,191
Useless.

205
00:09:40,639 --> 00:09:41,639
Foolish lover.

206
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:42,480
Your heart has been stirred.

207
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:45,320
She's no longer just an illusion to you.

208
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,440
Just like
in the Thousand-Fold Love Ordeal,

209
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,039
you've fallen for her again.

210
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,200
Enough!

211
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,080
Enough with

212
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,440
all this love nonsense!

213
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,600
This young Taoist...

214
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:14,039
Could it be

215
00:10:14,039 --> 00:10:15,559
related to the bite mark?

216
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:19,960
Perfect. I'll take him out
while he's asleep.

217
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:23,039
Let me see what's really in his heart.

218
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,399
(I'm drawn to you.)

219
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,840
(My heart belongs to you.)

220
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,120
(I care about you most.)

221
00:10:32,399 --> 00:10:33,480
(I want to be with you.)

222
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,080
Young Taoist.

223
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,919
So you do have someone you like.

224
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:40,840
(Why does seeing this)

225
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:43,399
(make me feel strangely lost?)

226
00:10:58,279 --> 00:10:59,475
You pesky Taoist!

227
00:10:59,862 --> 00:11:01,759
So you already have someone.

228
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,279
Wake up!

229
00:11:03,279 --> 00:11:04,360
Wake up!

230
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,639
Wake up!

231
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,639
You pesky Taoist!

232
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,399
Typical man.

233
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,679
Always thinking about women.

234
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,519
Shameless.

235
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,039
Despicable.

236
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:27,720
(I can't let him affect me.)

237
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,759
(I need to eat him soon.)

238
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,480
This is bad.

239
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:34,679
Turning into a man again.

240
00:11:35,159 --> 00:11:36,919
(With Yin-Yang Reversal this often,)

241
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,080
(if I don't eat him soon,)

242
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,937
(I won't last much longer.)

243
00:11:47,087 --> 00:11:48,175
Wait for me!

244
00:11:49,799 --> 00:11:51,000
Why are you a man again?

245
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:53,159
How should I know?

246
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:55,000
It is all your fault, all your fault.

247
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,639
You, you, you! All your fault!

248
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:00,440
Pesky Taoist!

249
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,039
Are you having a tantrum?

250
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,120
This is a maze.

251
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,120
Not your home.

252
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,639
Every direction leads somewhere.

253
00:12:13,279 --> 00:12:14,200
Spiderleaf Nest.

254
00:12:24,279 --> 00:12:25,240
They say

255
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,000
follow them and we'll get out.

256
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,639
Let's go.

257
00:12:40,279 --> 00:12:41,080
Don't move.

258
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:42,360
Spiderleaf feeds on spirit.

259
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:42,759
The more you use your power,

260
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:43,159
the more you use your power,

261
00:12:43,159 --> 00:12:43,960
the deeper you sink.

262
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,120
Once we're fully trapped,

263
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:45,919
it will consume us

264
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:46,919
until nothing remains.

265
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,360
What are you doing?

266
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,679
Spiderleaf doesn't like plain flesh.

267
00:12:53,679 --> 00:12:54,519
Just shed your outer layers,

268
00:12:54,519 --> 00:12:55,320
suppress your power,

269
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,320
and you'll stop sinking.

270
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,360
Take it off!

271
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,240
Young Taoist.

272
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:01,279
No. You can't.

273
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,039
Forget propriety. Just do it!

274
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:03,720
Take it off!

275
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,720
Did you bring me here on purpose?

276
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,240
The spider told me

277
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,559
this way leads out.

278
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:16,480
How was I supposed to know
it was a trap?

279
00:13:18,799 --> 00:13:19,759
(It stopped.)

280
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,279
Break!

281
00:13:49,919 --> 00:13:51,000
Your foot...

282
00:13:54,919 --> 00:13:56,399
You were hurt by the Spiderleaf Nest.

283
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:27,368
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

284
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:30,854
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

285
00:14:30,854 --> 00:14:34,368
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

286
00:14:34,554 --> 00:14:37,488
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

287
00:14:37,768 --> 00:14:44,538
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

288
00:14:45,184 --> 00:14:51,872
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

289
00:14:52,778 --> 00:14:56,448
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

290
00:14:56,558 --> 00:15:00,248
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

291
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:06,654
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
